cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use WAFER in academic work, please cite the thesis it
  supports rather than the software repository alone.
type: software
title: "WAFER: WebAssembly Flow Execution Runtime"
abstract: >-
  WAFER is a research prototype runtime for DAG-shaped IoT edge
  pipelines whose transform, filter, and router nodes are executed as
  WebAssembly Component Model plugins. It was developed as the
  software artefact for a Computer Science TCC/TG2 thesis at the
  Federal University of Rio Grande do Sul (UFRGS).
authors:
